   "narration": {
    "en": "Long ago, a poor farmer lived at the foot of a mountain with his aged, widowed mother. In the country, the old were to be abandoned, and the farmer, with a heavy heart, prepared food for her, tied it in a square cloth and carried her up the mountain."
